WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:02.720
WHEN I WAS A LITTLE GIRL,
MY MOTHER TOOK ME

00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:04.320
TO SEE ONE OF HER
FAVORITE FILMS.

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:06.607
FELLINI'S "LA STRADA"

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:11.120
I WAS A LITTLE YOUNG TO READ
SUBTITLES, BUT NONETHELESS

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:14.160
SHE'S AN ACTOR, AND SHE
WANTED TO SHARE WITH ME

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:16.800
ONE OF THE MOST
EXTRAORDINARY PERFORMANCES

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:18.320
THAT OF GIULIETTA MASINA.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.280
HER PERFORMANCE, AND THAT
FILM, WERE FILLED WITH MAGIC AND

00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:28.730
HEARTBREAK, AND TRUTH.
AND IT WAS NOT THE WORDS,

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:32.080
BUT THE LANGUAGE OF
CINEMA ITSELF THAT

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:33.684
TRANSFORMED ME FOREVER.

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:39.680
I ALSO LEARNED THAT "LA STRADA"
WAS THE FIRST FILM TO WIN

00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:41.920
THE OSCAR IN THIS
NEXT CATEGORY.

00:00:42.880 --> 00:00:47.530
HERE ARE THE NOMINEES FOR BEST
INTERNATIONAL FEATURE FILM.

00:00:47.840 --> 00:00:49.760
FROM DENMARK,
"ANOTHER ROUND."

00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:51.840
DIRECTED BY
THOMAS VINTERBERG.

00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:53.760
FROM HONG KONG,
"BETTER DAYS."

00:00:53.760 --> 00:00:56.240
DIRECTED BY
DEREK KWOK-CHEUNG TSANG.

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.240
FROM ROMANIA, "COLLECTIVE."

00:00:58.240 --> 00:01:01.200
DIRECTED BY
ALEXANDER NANAU.

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:04.160
FROM TUNISIA, "THE MAN
WHO SOLD HIS SKIN."

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:06.560
DIRECTED BY
KAOUTHER BEN HANIA.

00:01:06.560 --> 00:01:10.320
FROM BOSNIA AND HERZEGOVINA,
"QUO VADIS, AIDA?"

00:01:10.320 --> 00:01:15.120
DIRECTED BY
JASMILA ZBANIC.

00:01:15.120 --> 00:01:17.640
AND THE OSCAR GOES TO --

00:01:18.320 --> 00:01:20.640
"ANOTHER ROUND," DENMARK

00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:25.048
DIRECTED BY
THOMAS VINTERBERG

00:01:25.048 --> 00:01:31.487
[ APPLAUSE ]

00:01:31.487 --> 00:01:35.010
HEY, WOW.

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:40.320
THANK YOU VERY MUCH.
THANKS TO THE ACADEMY

00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:43.760
FOR VOTIING ON THIS FILM.
THIS IS BEYOND ANYTHING I COULD

00:01:43.760 --> 00:01:48.459
EVER IMAGINE, EXCEPT THIS IS
SOMETHING I'VE ALWAYS IMAGINED

00:01:49.840 --> 00:01:52.720
SINCE I WAS 5 OR SOMETHING.
I'VE BEEN PREPARING SPEECHES

00:01:53.760 --> 00:01:59.248
IN TRAIN STATIONS, AT SCHOOL,
IN THE TOILET.

00:02:00.080 --> 00:02:02.381
AND HERE I AM, IT'S REAL.
IT'S AMAZING.

00:02:02.960 --> 00:02:07.280
WOW. THIS IS A FILM
ABOUT LETTING GO

00:02:07.280 --> 00:02:11.120
OF CONTROL IN LIFE, AND AS I
LOST CONTROL IN MY OWN.

00:02:12.320 --> 00:02:16.000
AND I WANT TO THANK MY WIFE,
HELENE, WHO SITS OVER HERE, FOR

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:17.773
BEING THE ANGEL OF THIS PROJECT.

00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:21.840
FOR GUIDING ME THROUGH THIS VERY
DIFFICULT PERIOD.

00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:26.720
I WANT TO THANK MY CHILDREN,
MY FAMILY, NANNA, IDA, ALBERT, LILY.

00:02:28.720 --> 00:02:30.790
MY SCREENWRITER,
TOBIAS LINDHOLM.

00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:35.600
WHO IS MY GUARDIAN ANGEL
IN BOTH LIVING AND WRITING.

00:02:36.160 --> 00:02:37.360
I'M SENDING YOU MY PRAISES.

00:02:40.240 --> 00:02:42.640
THERE'S A LOT OF PEOPLE TO
THANK, BUT I'LL GET THERE.

00:02:43.562 --> 00:02:50.114
I'M SENDING MY PRAISES TO
ZENTROPA, SISSE, KASPER, PETER,

00:02:50.114 --> 00:02:52.400
KORNUM, ALL OF YOU.

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:55.564
YOU HAD SO MUCH HEART AND
STRENGTH AT THE SAME TIME.

00:02:56.880 --> 00:02:59.040
THE CREW, WHO THREW EVERYTHING
THEY HAD IN THEIR HANDS,

00:02:59.600 --> 00:03:03.840
TO RESCUE ME,
AND RESCUE THIS FILM.

00:03:04.760 --> 00:03:11.760
THE INVESTORS, MY AGENTS,
DISTRIBUTORS, SAMUEL GOLDWYN

00:03:11.760 --> 00:03:16.480
BART WALKER, ALL OF YOU,
CHRISTINA BAZDEKIS, JESSICA SYKES,

00:03:16.480 --> 00:03:18.674
BUMBLE. YOU'RE ALL THERE.

00:03:19.520 --> 00:03:23.600
CINETIC, THANK YOU FOR SHOWING THE
BRAVERY OF INVESTING IN A MOVIE

00:03:23.600 --> 00:03:29.520
THAT IS ABOUT FOUR DEPRAVED,
WHITE, DRUNK MEN, BASICALLY.

00:03:30.400 --> 00:03:32.960
WHO TEACHES CHILDREN
TO DRINK AS WELL.

00:03:33.520 --> 00:03:36.160
I MEAN, PRETTY UPHILL,
IN MY PERSPECTIVE.

00:03:37.600 --> 00:03:41.440
THOSE FOUR WHITE MEN BEING
MAGNUS MILLANG, LARS RANTHE,

00:03:43.440 --> 00:03:47.040
THOMAS BO LARSEN, MY OLD FRIEND.
THE WHOLE CAST, YOU WERE BRILLIANT.

00:03:47.040 --> 00:03:50.400
SUSAN, MARIA, ALL OF YOU, TOOK
OUT YOUR HEARTS FOR THIS

00:03:51.360 --> 00:03:52.240
AND WERE BRILLIANT.

00:03:52.240 --> 00:03:54.400
I WANT TO SEND A SPECIAL
THANKS, OF COURSE,

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:55.922
TO MADS MIKKELSON.

00:03:57.680 --> 00:03:59.840
YEAH, GIVE HIM A HAND.

00:03:59.840 --> 00:04:02.320
[ APPLAUSE ]

00:04:02.320 --> 00:04:05.440
MADS, YOU GAVE US YOUR FINEST.

00:04:07.103 --> 00:04:10.214
NOT JUST FOR THE FILM, BUT FOR
MY DAUGHTER AS WELL.

00:04:10.640 --> 00:04:12.213
AND I'LL NEVER FORGET IT.

00:04:12.213 --> 00:04:14.159
WHOO, OKAY.

00:04:14.720 --> 00:04:18.400
SO, WE WANTED TO MAKE
A FILM THAT CELEBRATES LIFE

00:04:19.280 --> 00:04:23.600
AND FOUR DAYS INTO SHOOTING,
THE IMPOSSIBLE HAPPENED.

00:04:25.680 --> 00:04:27.840
AN ACCIDENT ON A HIGHWAY
TOOK MY DAUGHTER AWAY.

00:04:29.360 --> 00:04:30.800
SOMEONE LOOKING INTO
A CELL PHONE.

00:04:33.280 --> 00:04:36.036
AND WE MISS HER, AND I LOVE HER

00:04:39.040 --> 00:04:44.180
AND -- SORRY.

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:48.720
TWO MONTHS BEFORE
WE SHOT THIS MOVIE,

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:50.370
AND TWO MONTHS
BEFORE SHE DIED,

00:04:50.960 --> 00:04:53.600
SHE WAS IN AFRICA.
SHE SENT ME A LETTER,

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:55.280
AND SHE JUST READ
THE SCRIPT, AND SHE WAS

00:04:55.280 --> 00:04:56.480
GLOWING WITH EXCITEMENT.

00:04:57.520 --> 00:05:00.320
SHE LOVED THIS
AND SHE FELT SEEN BY THIS

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:03.520
AND SHE WAS SUPPOSED
TO BE IN THIS

00:05:03.520 --> 00:05:07.680
AND IF ANYONE DARES TO BELIEVE
THAT SHE'S HERE WITH US SOMEHOW,

00:05:08.800 --> 00:05:12.945
YOU'LL BE ABLE TO SEE HER
CLAPPING AND CHEERING WITH US.

00:05:14.400 --> 00:05:17.280
WE ENDED UP MAKING THIS MOVIE
FOR HER, AS HER MONUMENT.

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:24.640
SO, IDA, THIS IS A MIRACLE THAT
JUST HAPPENED, AND YOU'RE A PART

00:05:24.640 --> 00:05:27.760
OF THIS MIRACLE.
MAYBE YOU'VE BEEN PULLING SOME

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:30.080
STRINGS SOMEWHERE, I DON'T KNOW.
BUT THIS ONE IS FOR YOU.

00:05:30.080 --> 00:05:37.840
THANK YOU VERY MUCH.

